<title>UK: RHEINHYP adds 500 million marks to May 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>RHEINHYP adds 500 million marks to May 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINHYP RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT ** 1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.5	 MATURITY    02.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.425   PAY DATE   *25.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  27.5 BP   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p>NOTES  **  ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 1.0 BLN DEM ON 24.APR.96</p>
<p>	   *  PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  21.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
